LLM Response
Employees may request a refund
within 30 days of purchase.

Source:
Employee_Handbook.pdf
Page 127
Hallucination Test (Mandatory)
Query
Who is the President of the USA?
Retrieval Result
No relevant documents
Expected Response
I don't know.

This information is not available
in the provided documents.

✅ No hallucination

✅ Context-only answer

