End of Week 2 Outcome

A fully functional Retrieval Engine that:

Retrieves relevant chunks accurately.
Handles conversational follow-up questions.
Uses hybrid retrieval (BM25 + semantic search).
Answers only from corporate documents.
Returns source citations and page numbers.
Refuses questions outside the knowledge base.
